<title>USA: U.S. business loans rose $5.5 bln in April 9 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans rose $5.5 bln in April 9 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks rose $5.5 billion to $806.2 billion in the week ended April 9, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
</text>
